{"slug":"/students/subjects/english/mechanics-punctuation/spelling-rules/","source":"students/subjects/english/mechanics-punctuation/spelling-rules.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Spelling Rules — Mechanics","description":"","subject":"english","body":"<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/english/mechanics-punctuation/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to Mechanics</a></nav>\n    <article class=\"card p-6 rounded-lg\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Spelling Rules</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Common patterns: doubling consonants, silent 'e' rules, suffix changes.</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"font-semibold\">Worked example</h2>\n      <p class=\"mb-2\">Form comparative of \"happy\"</p>\n      <p class=\"mb-4\"><strong>Solution:</strong> \"happier\" (drop 'y' add 'ier').</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Practice</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-5 mb-4 text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Spell plural of \"leaf\"</li>\n        <li>Change to comparative: \"big\"</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h4 class=\"font-semibold\">Brief answers</h4>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-5 text-gray-700\">\n        <li>leaves</li>\n        <li>bigger</li>\n      </ol>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-50 to-orange-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.card{ -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}